### ==================================================
### Ticket System API Tests
### Module: Helpdesk & Customer Support (Prompt 8)
### ==================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@acmeToken = {{loginAcme.response.body.token}}
@techStartToken = {{loginTechStart.response.body.token}}

### ==================================================
### SETUP - Authentication
### ==================================================

### Login as Acme Tenant
# @name loginAcme
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "email": "john@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as TechStart Tenant
# @name loginTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "email": "jane@techstart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================================================
### TICKET CRUD - Create Tickets
### ==================================================

### Create Ticket 1 - High Priority Support Ticket
# @name createTicket1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "System Login Issue - Urgent",
  "description": "Customer unable to login to the system. Getting 'Invalid credentials' error even with correct password. Needs immediate attention.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "category": "TECHNICAL_SUPPORT",
  "source": "EMAIL",
  "slaDeadline": "2025-01-10T18:00:00Z",
  "tags": ["urgent", "login", "authentication"]
}

### Create Ticket 2 - Medium Priority Feature Request
# @name createTicket2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Feature Request - Export to Excel",
  "description": "Customer requested ability to export reports to Excel format. Currently only PDF export is available.",
  "contactId": "contact-2-acme",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "category": "FEATURE_REQUEST",
  "source": "PHONE",
  "tags": ["feature", "export", "reporting"]
}

### Create Ticket 3 - Low Priority General Inquiry
# @name createTicket3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Question about Subscription Plans",
  "description": "Customer asking about differences between Basic and Pro plans. What additional features are included in Pro?",
  "contactId": "contact-3-acme",
  "assigneeId": "user-1-acme",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "category": "QUESTION",
  "source": "CHAT",
  "tags": ["subscription", "pricing", "plans"]
}

### Create Ticket 4 - Critical Bug Report with SLA
# @name createTicket4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Data Loss During Sync - CRITICAL",
  "description": "Customer reported data loss during synchronization process. Multiple records missing after sync. This affects production environment.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "assigneeId": "user-2-acme",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "category": "BUG",
  "source": "PORTAL",
  "slaDeadline": "2025-01-08T12:00:00Z",
  "tags": ["critical", "data-loss", "sync", "production"]
}

### Create Ticket for TechStart Tenant
# @name createTicketTechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "subject": "Account Access Request",
  "description": "New user needs access to the admin portal. Please create account and send credentials.",
  "contactId": "contact-1-techstart",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "category": "ACCOUNT_MANAGEMENT",
  "source": "EMAIL",
  "tags": ["access", "new-user"]
}

### ==================================================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### ==================================================

### Create Ticket - Missing Subject (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "description": "Ticket without subject",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Ticket - Missing Description (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Test Ticket",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme"
}

### Create Ticket - Missing ContactId (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "Ticket without contact"
}

### Create Ticket - Invalid Contact (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "Ticket with invalid contact",
  "contactId": "non-existent-contact"
}

### Create Ticket - Invalid Assignee (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "Ticket with invalid assignee",
  "contactId": "contact-1-acme",
  "assigneeId": "non-existent-user"
}

### ==================================================
### READ OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Get All Tickets (Acme Tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get All Tickets with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?page=1&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Ticket by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Ticket by Ticket Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/number/1
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Get Ticket by Ticket Number - Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/number/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

