### SEARCH & FILTERS
### ==================================================

### Search by Subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=Login
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Search by Description
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=export
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Search by Ticket Number (numeric search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=1
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Status - OPEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Status - IN_PROGRESS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=IN_PROGRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Priority - HIGH
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Priority - URGENT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?priority=URGENT
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Category - TECHNICAL_SUPPORT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?category=TECHNICAL_SUPPORT
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Category - BUG
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?category=BUG
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Source - EMAIL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?source=EMAIL
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?contactId=contact-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Assignee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?assigneeId=user-1-acme
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Current User's Assigned Tickets (using "me")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?assigneeId=me
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Tags - Single Tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?tags=urgent
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by Tags - Multiple Tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?tags=urgent,critical
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by SLA - Past Due
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?slaPast=true
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Filter by SLA - Not Past Due
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?slaPast=false
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - High Priority Open Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Combined Filters - Technical Support Emails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?category=TECHNICAL_SUPPORT&source=EMAIL
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### SORTING
### ==================================================

### Sort by Priority (DESC - Most urgent first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=priority&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Created Date (DESC - Newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by Ticket Number (ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=ticketNumber&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### Sort by SLA Deadline (ASC - Most urgent first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=slaDeadline&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

### ==================================================
### UPDATE OPERATIONS
### ==================================================

### Update Ticket - Basic Fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "subject": "System Login Issue - RESOLVED",
  "description": "Customer unable to login. Issue was due to expired password. Password reset link sent and customer can now login successfully.",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Update Ticket - Assign to User
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket2.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "assigneeId": "user-2-acme"
}

### Update Ticket - Add Tags
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket2.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "tags": ["feature", "export", "reporting", "excel", "in-progress"]
}

### Update Ticket - Change Priority
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket3.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Update Ticket - Set SLA Deadline
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket2.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "slaDeadline": "2025-01-15T17:00:00Z"
}

### ==================================================
### STATUS TRANSITIONS
### ==================================================

### Update Status - OPEN to IN_PROGRESS
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Update Status - IN_PROGRESS to PENDING
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### Update Status - PENDING to IN_PROGRESS (back)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Update Status - IN_PROGRESS to RESOLVED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Update Status - RESOLVED to CLOSED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### Update Status - Invalid Status (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket2.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "INVALID_STATUS"
}

### Complete Workflow - Ticket 4 (OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED -> CLOSED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket4.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket4.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket4.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
X-Tenant: acme

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

