### ==================================================
### TENANT ISOLATION
### ==================================================

### Attempt to Access Acme Ticket from TechStart (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Attempt to Update Acme Ticket from TechStart (should fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

{
  "subject": "Attempting to modify another tenant's ticket"
}

### Attempt to Delete Acme Ticket from TechStart (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket1.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

### Verify TechStart Can Only See Their Own Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{techStartToken}}
X-Tenant: techstart

